<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have increased their military presence near the Myanmar border in Mae Sot district as Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre in a border village and artillery strikes hit villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting warning shots and a temporary closure of unofficial border trade. Thai police arrested two Singaporeans for advertising Thai women’s sex services via messaging apps and seized meth pills hidden in furniture, while Cambodian nationals were detained for illegal crossing and Myanmar military warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPZ0U3YnhvVXhUc1FMNnpIZ2ZlTExqZXU2VTU4SWxRZDFiRE9vVl9UT2xHSUpVRS1sWWVKbTVmazVWbnI1Vm1GaEhvOGtmNTZpRFF1UHljcklOdlRuTmV0TTN4SWNFSVNFeWQybWlsXzFTU21aU0c5d2ljMS1MT1R4bjhYQ0N2LTlNYThR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQWl96ZklTVXZkdlpYUEVtTTljclBLcE9FREh3MWtIajBBYy0xR3hkOGN3ZFhUaExsakNHMDRRNENKNEVUVmNXcVY2TVF5XzRLcHotM0MyekFxcnpfNEF1NXc3c0JENV9ldWdHOWJ6cUlFMWJsWTF0WHhXNGhQV3hhOFJXRmFaZlhLQ1JVcFl2T3ZEX2gzTEkzbjJreDlMRmRsM3N6UzRWZng?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bangkok Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOZjQybFFjNlRkc0ZXVkpIMzd4RmdBR0pQUEswMmdkZHE1a05OZmlxNFpucnVLRFlKN1hrMU5xZEhtUDFWMml2TmkyNVRhMlkyZkNRcWlpd2JMMnVyYTBuQnN1cElzR0ZMdWFCWFZXeUJtRWp2dFhKM1lyY3A4dGFOS1BWTEt5VzdHdjRQZmk0WmJCRmxJUXE3VkNKak12RWdCYkR1SXFmUU44bEVXUU1LSm5EMFBtWllsdGtBN3UzdDlibEda?oc=5&quot;&gt;Stomp Singapore&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTE91RV9BZG5IM3Rvem1UbHZtbGF6eThMdHQ1aERjNUNJcll3c010R0RHSHBvOGkzOFk2eFQ1eEt2SlQwNmVPUWd1aExxMGwyWHBqV2k2Z2Q3aExWS0tEcHh5VzFaZTdVdEVGY2pfWTZvWE9QUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nation Thai